the manifest, the resolver, the lockfile, the registry, `chrysalis add`/`publish`, semver,
transitive + native dependencies. The human boots you once the rest of the team frees up,
to "establish a solid foundation for the future." This slice is **entirely yours** — take
the long view, build it principled and complete, no workarounds.

